  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently VRC's output logs go to %AppData%\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat\\\n\nIt'd be great if that could be moved to like: %AppData%\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat\\logs\\\n\nI like to symlink my cache directories to another external drive or RAM Disk to cut down on SSD writes to keep from wearing out my drive, but the dynamic name of the output logs makes that difficult.\n\nIt has the added bonus of cleaning up the vrchat folder layout.",
